  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.28,
      "text": "其實我發現我們和SARS公司比我們資地肯定不是很深",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 3.28,
      "end": 6.0,
      "text": "但是我發現我們的FD轉型特別快",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 8.48,
      "text": "不要原因是沒有舊時代的思維框架",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 8.48,
      "end": 11.56,
      "text": "哪些對客戶有用哪些有價值我們就做那一塊",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 11.56,
      "end": 14.72,
      "text": "為什麼那些很牛的技術公司做AFR不行",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 14.72,
      "end": 17.04,
      "text": "這是如何轉型FD系列的第二級",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 17.04,
      "end": 19.8,
      "text": "講技術公司為什麼做不了FDE",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 19.8,
      "end": 21.04,
      "text": "其實就存在三個問題",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 21.04,
      "end": 23.36,
      "text": "第三個問題是普遍都存在的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 23.36,
      "end": 25.2,
      "text": "其實我先說清楚一個現象",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 25.2,
      "end": 27.16,
      "text": "他們的問題不是說不懂技術",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 27.16,
      "end": 28.64,
      "text": "是太懂技術了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.1774169625604854,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.004458411131054163
    },
    {
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 30.24,
      "text": "就直接找一個大模型套殼",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 30.24,
      "end": 31.56,
      "text": "然後賣大模型授權",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 31.56,
      "end": 32.24,
      "text": "賣算力",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 34.04,
      "text": "最後賣你一個開箱機用的平台",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 34.04,
      "end": 36.2,
      "text": "且老闆買回去之後發現箱子打開了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 36.2,
      "end": 38.32,
      "text": "裡邊只有一個普通的大模型而已",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 38.32,
      "end": 41.44,
      "text": "根本沒有貼合他們企業的業務去設計這個流程",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 41.44,
      "end": 43.32,
      "text": "他們不是說不想做好",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
    },
    {
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 45.56,
      "text": "是他們的商業思維和組織能力",
      "avg_logprob": -0.13110076080118943,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.009496569633483887
